Applies to: res.json (599 generated stories, expert annotations, prompt
metadata) and any derived data tables in analysis/out/.

You are free to share and adapt this material for any purpose, including
commercially, provided you give appropriate credit, link to the licence, and
indicate if changes were made.

Full licence text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

NOTE ON MODEL OUTPUTS. The stories in res.json are outputs of third-party
language models (OpenAI, Google, Mistral, Alibaba/Qwen). Each provider's terms
of use assign rights in generated output to the requesting user, and this
corpus is redistributed on that basis for research use. Provider terms change;
anyone reusing the stories should check the current terms of the provider
concerned.

NOTE ON CULTURAL CONTENT. These stories are machine-generated research
artifacts and evaluation targets. They are NOT authentic folklore of the Bengali,
Chakma, Marma, Santal, Garo (Mandi), Khasi, Manipuri (Meitei), Mro, Tripura,
Hajong, Rakhine or Oraon (Kurukh) communities, and the accompanying paper
documents specific ways in which they misrepresent those communities. Do not
redistribute them as cultural documentation.

